# fff seek in seven years of teaching: a few letters of the path find one
# file among more than a thousand, and Enter leaves the shell beside it.
Output docs/demos/task-find.gif
Require fff
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1280
Set Height 780
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 90ms

Hide
Type "exec docs/demos/session.sh"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

Type "fff seek" Sleep 400ms Enter Sleep 1.5s
Type@200ms "lin07sol" Sleep 2s
Ctrl+U Sleep 400ms
Type@200ms "2024lin07sol" Sleep 2s
Enter Sleep 1.5s
Type "ls" Sleep 300ms Enter Sleep 2.5s
